# Cloudflare Worker Environment Secrets (.dev.vars)
# 100% Compatible with Cloudflare Workers Free Tier (100,000 requests/day at $0 cost)
#
# For local development: copy this file to `.dev.vars`
# For Cloudflare production deployment:
#   Either set secrets via CLI: `wrangler secret put <KEY>`
#   Or set in Cloudflare Dashboard: Workers & Pages > your-worker > Settings > Variables and Secrets

# ==============================================================================
# 1. Council Master Security Passcode (Decoupled Authentication)
# ==============================================================================
# Set any secure passphrase or token of your choice.
# When set, only council members providing this token can verify access to admin APIs.
COUNCIL_AUTH_TOKEN="GMC@Council2026!Admin"

# ==============================================================================
# 2. Free AI Intelligence Engine (Zero Cost)
# ==============================================================================
# Groq API Key (Free tier: ultra-fast Llama 3.3 70B inference at https://console.groq.com)
GROQ_API_KEY=""

# Google Gemini API Key (Free tier: 15 RPM at https://aistudio.google.com)
GEMINI_API_KEY=""

# ==============================================================================
# 3. Free Telegram Bot Live Relay & Notification Alerts
# ==============================================================================
# Bot token created free via Telegram @BotFather
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=""

# Telegram Council Group Chat ID or Council Admin personal Telegram user ID
# (Get via @userinfobot or invite bot to group and check updates)
TELEGRAM_ADMIN_CHAT_ID=""

# Optional secret string to verify incoming Telegram webhook authenticity
TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET=""

# ==============================================================================
# 4. Optional Firebase Service Account (For Cloud Firestore backend sync)
# ==============================================================================
# If left empty, portal operates with client-side & in-memory serverless storage
FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=""
FIREBASE_CLIENT_EMAIL=""
FIREBASE_PRIVATE_KEY=""

# ==============================================================================
# 5. Optional Gmail API Integration (For council email notifications)
# ==============================================================================
GMAIL_CLIENT_ID=""
GMAIL_CLIENT_SECRET=""
GMAIL_REFRESH_TOKEN=""
GMAIL_SENDER_EMAIL=""
COUNCIL_RECIPIENT_EMAIL=""
